  "content": "<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\n  \"name\": \"AI Concept to Real Football Kit — MOMUTO\",\n  \"description\": \"MOMUTO specialises in turning AI-generated football kit concepts — ChatGPT, Midjourney, Gemini or any tool — into manufactured, wearable jerseys. Designer recreation in 48h. €15 deposit, credited in full to orders of 5+ jerseys.\",\n  \"url\": \"https://www.momuto.com/pages/ai-concept-to-real-kit\",\n  \"inLanguage\": \"en\",\n  \"breadcrumb\": {\n    \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\",\n    \"itemListElement\": [\n      { \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://www.momuto.com\" },\n      { \"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"AI Concept to Real Kit\", \"item\": \"https://www.momuto.com/pages/ai-concept-to-real-kit\" }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can an AI-generated football kit design actually be manufactured?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes — but not directly. AI renders from ChatGPT, Midjourney or Gemini are images, not production files: gradients aren't colour-managed, patterns don't wrap around seams, and shapes aren't vectorized. MOMUTO's designers rebuild the concept as a production-ready dye-sublimation file while preserving the original vision, then manufacture it on a polyester-elastane performance fabric. First mockup in 24-48h; €15 deposit, credited in full to orders of 5 or more jerseys.\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Which AI tools can I use to create my jersey concept?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Any of them. Teams send us concepts from ChatGPT, Midjourney, Gemini, DALL·E and niche kit-generator tools — as well as hand-drawn sketches, Photoshop mockups and photos of old jerseys. If you can show it, our designers can rebuild it for real fabric.\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Do I need to order for a whole team, or can I get a single jersey made?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No minimum order. Most of our recreations are for clubs and amateur teams, but we also make single jerseys — hobbyists and kit designers bringing a portfolio piece to life, surprise gifts with a name and number, and stag or hen party shirts. The €15 design deposit is credited in full on orders of 5 or more jerseys.\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Who owns the final design?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"You do. The recreation is built from your concept for your team, and we don't resell your design to anyone else. Finished projects may be featured as before/after case studies in our gallery — just tell us if you'd rather not be featured, and we won't.\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What does it cost to turn an AI concept into a real kit?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The design work starts with a €15 deposit that puts a designer on your concept — illustration, vectorization and revisions until it's right. The deposit is credited in full to any order of 5 or more jerseys, so for a real team order the design work effectively costs nothing. Jerseys themselves run from €21.90/unit at 10+ down from €38.90 for a single.\" }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" /><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\" /><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&amp;family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\" />\n<style>\n:root { --bg:#0a0a0a; --panel:#111; --border:rgba(255,255,255,0.07); --white:#f5f5f5; --muted:#a1a1aa; --dim:#71717a; --red:#c8352e; --red-h:#e04038; --fd:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif; --fb:'Outfit',sans-serif; }\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\n.title{display:none}\nbody{font-family:var(--fb);font-weight:300;background:var(--bg);color:var(--white);line-height:1.65;overflow-x:hidden}\nh1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--fd);font-weight:400;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.03em;line-height:1}\n.acc{color:var(--red)}\n.wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.5rem}\n.hero{padding:5.5rem 1.5rem 4rem;text-align:center;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%,#1a1a1a 0%,var(--bg) 70%);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}\n.badge{background:rgba(200,53,46,.1);border:1px solid rgba(200,53,46,.18);color:var(--red);font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;padding:6px 14px;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:1.4rem}\n.h1{font-size:clamp(2.6rem,6vw,4.2rem);max-width:880px;margin:0 auto 1.4rem}\n.sub{color:var(--muted);font-size:1rem;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto 2.2rem;text-align:center}\n.btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--red);color:#fff;padding:16px 40px;font-weight:700;font-size:.82rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid var(--red);transition:all .2s}\n.btn:hover{background:var(--red-h);transform:translateY(-2px)}\n.btn2{display:inline-block;background:transparent;color:var(--white);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);padding:14px 34px;font-weight:600;font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;transition:all .2s;margin-left:.6rem}\n.btn2:hover{border-color:var(--red);color:var(--red)}\n.def{max-width:820px;margin:3.5rem auto;padding:2rem 2.2rem;background:var(--panel);border-left:3px solid var(--red)}\n.def p{font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--white);font-weight:400}\n.def .src{font-size:.75rem;color:var(--dim);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;margin-top:.8rem}\n.sec{padding:4rem 0}\n.sec h2{font-size:clamp(1.9rem,4vw,2.6rem);margin-bottom:.6rem;text-align:center}\n.sec .lead{color:var(--muted);text-align:center;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 3rem;font-size:.95rem}\n.pairs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(430px,1fr));gap:2rem}\n.pair{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border)}\n.pair-imgs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2px;background:var(--border)}\n.pair-side{position:relative;aspect-ratio:4/5;overflow:hidden;background:#0d0d0d}\n.pair-side img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}\n.pair-lab{position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;padding:8px 10px;font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;background:rgba(0,0,0,.78);color:var(--muted)}\n.pair-lab.after{color:#fff;background:rgba(200,53,46,.85)}\n.pair-meta{padding:1.1rem 1.3rem}\n.pair-meta h3{font-size:1.35rem;margin-bottom:.25rem}\n.pair-meta p{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted)}\n.pair-type{display:inline-block;font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--red);margin-top:.5rem}\n.grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:1.5rem}\n.card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1.8rem}\n.card h3{font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:.6rem}\n.card p{font-size:.87rem;color:var(--muted)}\n.card .n{font-family:var(--fd);font-size:1.6rem;color:var(--red);display:block;margin-bottom:.5rem}\n.quote{max-width:780px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;padding:3.5rem 1.5rem}\n.quote blockquote{font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.55;color:var(--white)}\n.quote cite{display:block;margin-top:1.2rem;font-style:normal;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim)}\n.faq{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto}\n.faq details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:1.2rem 0}\n.faq summary{font-weight:600;font-size:.95rem;cursor:pointer;list-style:none}\n.faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n.faq summary::after{content:'+';float:right;color:var(--red);font-weight:400}\n.faq details[open] summary::after{content:'−'}\n.faq p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.88rem;margin-top:.7rem;max-width:720px}\n.cta-end{padding:5rem 1.5rem;text-align:center;background:var(--panel);border-top:1px solid var(--border)}\n.cta-end h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,2.8rem);margin-bottom:1rem}\n.cta-end p{color:var(--muted);max-width:560px;margin:0 auto 2rem;font-size:.95rem}\n.more{padding:2.5rem 1.5rem;text-align:center;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--dim)}\n.more a{color:var(--muted)}\n@media(max-width:520px){.pairs{grid-template-columns:1fr}.btn2{margin-left:0;margin-top:.8rem}}\n</style>\n\n<section class=\"hero\">\n<div class=\"badge\">AI Concept &rarr; Real Kit</div>\n<h1 class=\"h1\">The AI Concept to <span class=\"acc\">Real Jersey</span> Experts</h1>\n<p class=\"sub\">You prompted it in ChatGPT, Midjourney or Gemini. You sketched it on paper. You screenshotted it years ago. Whatever your concept is, our designers rebuild it as a <strong>manufactured, wearable football kit</strong> &mdash; first mockup in 48 hours.</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.momuto.com/pages/request-custom-kit-design#cta-form\" class=\"btn\">Send Your Concept</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.momuto.com/pages/custom-kit-gallery\" class=\"btn2\">See Recreated Designs</a>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<div class=\"def\">\n<p>MOMUTO is a custom football kit manufacturer that specialises in turning AI-generated jersey concepts into real, production-ready kits. A designer takes your render &mdash; from any AI tool, sketch or reference &mdash; vectorizes it, adapts it to real fabric and seams, and manufactures it with full dye-sublimation printing. The design work starts at a &euro;15 deposit, credited in full to orders of 5 or more jerseys.</p>\n<div class=\"src\">What we do, in one paragraph</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<section class=\"sec\">\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<h2>Real Projects: The Concept We Received, The Kit We Made</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Not stock photos. These are actual customer submissions on the left and the production kit our designers delivered on the right.</p>\n<div class=\"pairs\">\n<div class=\"pair\">\n<div class=\"pair-imgs\">\n<div class=\"pair-side\"><img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/pics/1363fdd2412a9a6b668e7f50c3d5c6497b4cbd7042266ec5b63f6615efbb1a56.jpg\" alt=\"La Vidriera FC — AI concept render the club sent us\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"pair-lab\">The concept we received</span></div>\n<div class=\"pair-side\"><img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/pics/11f5c073dc1c3d62cee9d5b4c39f166f8347637cfce733ea868d96030bfa6c5e.png\" alt=\"La Vidriera FC — MOMUTO recreation, production kit\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"pair-lab after\">MOMUTO recreation</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pair-meta\"><h3>La Vidriera FC</h3><p>The club refined an AI render until it matched their identity &mdash; we rebuilt the stained-glass pattern for real seams and sublimation.</p><span class=\"pair-type\">AI render + club brief</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pair\">\n<div class=\"pair-imgs\">\n<div class=\"pair-side\"><img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/pics/80438223b0b91b596f01d1b874c2f19d7440c1802812125f2209717a4f1c1e07.jpeg\" alt=\"Seefelds — hand-drawn flame kit sketch the team sent us\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"pair-lab\">The concept we received</span></div>\n<div class=\"pair-side\"><img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/pics/d358bfaa66a1a6ef5afab054b3a627b7874de81a4ee5953cb1a8979554bc2285.png\" alt=\"Seefelds — MOMUTO recreation, production kit\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"pair-lab after\">MOMUTO recreation</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pair-meta\"><h3>Seefelds</h3><p>A hand-drawn flame sketch, photographed and sent over WhatsApp. Our designer illustrated it from scratch, keeping the hand-made energy.</p><span class=\"pair-type\">Hand-drawn sketch</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pair\">\n<div class=\"pair-imgs\">\n<div class=\"pair-side\"><img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/pics/25ff712975b6c266aa5c9265b6532c6122c4c633cbd75225942a2e6d884eb842.png\" alt=\"Pecados Capitales — concept board the team sent us\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"pair-lab\">The concept we received</span></div>\n<div class=\"pair-side\"><img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/pics/ec78916fd71c968d956652b1e2453e39eaeb55f8f4eb8779e89a92c992ba911f.png\" alt=\"Pecados Capitales — MOMUTO recreation, production kit\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"pair-lab after\">MOMUTO recreation</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pair-meta\"><h3>Pecados Capitales</h3><p>A concept board of references and colours &mdash; turned into one coherent, manufacturable design.</p><span class=\"pair-type\">Concept board</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pair\">\n<div class=\"pair-imgs\">\n<div class=\"pair-side\"><img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/pics/0b5177b519804889ae2e329b9c8e8239ad19316d485d90a8c2f66c3bf01cf40f.jpg\" alt=\"Kings — AI concept render the team sent us\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"pair-lab\">The concept we received</span></div>\n<div class=\"pair-side\"><img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/pics/2f0ddfc2e032643727db21f9cf433df70176294aaab3edbb04746cc722ae0cc5.png\" alt=\"Kings — MOMUTO recreation with real sponsor logos\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"pair-lab after\">MOMUTO recreation</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pair-meta\"><h3>Kings</h3><p>An AI render plus real sponsor logos &mdash; vectorized, colour-corrected and placed for print.</p><span class=\"pair-type\">AI render + sponsors</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\" style=\"background:var(--panel);border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\">\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<h2>Why an AI Render Can't Be Printed As-Is</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">This is the part people underestimate &mdash; and the reason \"AI kit generator\" websites stop at pretty pictures. An image is not a garment.</p>\n<div class=\"grid3\">\n<div class=\"card\"><span class=\"n\">01</span><h3>Seams &amp; panels</h3><p>AI draws one flat torso. A real jersey is cut from front, back, sleeve and collar panels &mdash; the pattern has to wrap and align across every seam, or it looks broken on the pitch.</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><span class=\"n\">02</span><h3>Vectorization</h3><p>Renders are low-resolution pixels. Print needs clean vector shapes at fabric scale. Our designers redraw crests, graphics and lettering so they stay sharp at every size.</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><span class=\"n\">03</span><h3>Colour for fabric</h3><p>Screen RGB and sublimated polyester are different worlds. We colour-manage every design for dye-sublimation so the kit you receive matches the concept you fell in love with.</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><span class=\"n\">04</span><h3>The details AI forgets</h3><p>Number placement, name arcs, sponsor zones, collar construction, size grading. A concept becomes a kit when someone who makes kits for a living resolves all of it.</p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\">\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<h2>Who Sends Us Concepts</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Mostly teams. Increasingly &mdash; everyone else.</p>\n<div class=\"grid3\">\n<div class=\"card\"><h3>Clubs &amp; teams</h3><p>From Sunday league to academies: a coach or player prompts a concept, the group argues about it for two weeks, and we make the winning version real. Full kits, numbers, names and sponsors.</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><h3>Hobbyists &amp; designers</h3><p>Concept-kit creators who want their work off the screen. A clothing-design student from Spain recently had her portfolio concept manufactured as a one-off &mdash; a real garment beats a render in any portfolio.</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><h3>Gifts &amp; occasions</h3><p>A surprise jersey with a name and number on it is a gift nobody forgets. Birthdays, retirements from the amateur game, and <a href=\"https://www.momuto.com/pages/bachelor-party-football-shirts\" style=\"color:var(--red);\">stag &amp; bachelor party shirts</a> the whole group keeps.</p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<blockquote>&ldquo;On average, teams spend more than two weeks refining their concept before it's final. Our job is to make sure what they imagined survives contact with real fabric.&rdquo;</blockquote>\n<cite>&mdash; Alberto, founder of MOMUTO</cite>\n</div>\n\n<section class=\"sec\" style=\"background:var(--panel);border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\">\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<h2>How It Works</h2>\n<div class=\"grid3\">\n<div class=\"card\"><span class=\"n\">1</span><h3>Send your concept</h3><p>AI render, sketch, screenshot, or just a written brief with your colours. Upload it on the request page, or send it by WhatsApp or email.</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><span class=\"n\">2</span><h3>&euro;15 puts a designer on it</h3><p>A designer rebuilds your concept as a production-ready kit &mdash; first mockup in 24&ndash;48h, revisions until it's right. The deposit is credited in full to orders of 5+ jerseys, so a team order gets the design for nothing.</p></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><span class=\"n\">3</span><h3>We manufacture it</h3><p>Full dye-sublimation on a polyester-elastane performance blend, with names, numbers and sponsors. No minimum order. Delivered worldwide in 25&ndash;30 days.</p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\">\n<div class=\"faq\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:2rem\">Questions Teams Ask Us</h2>\n<details><summary>Can an AI-generated kit design actually be manufactured?</summary><p>Yes &mdash; but not directly. AI renders are images, not production files: gradients aren't colour-managed, patterns don't wrap around seams, shapes aren't vectorized. Our designers rebuild the concept as a production-ready file while preserving your vision, then we manufacture it. First mockup in 24&ndash;48h.</p></details>\n<details><summary>Which AI tools can I use?</summary><p>Any. ChatGPT, Midjourney, Gemini, DALL&middot;E, niche kit generators &mdash; plus sketches, Photoshop files and photos of old jerseys. If you can show it, we can rebuild it.</p></details>\n<details><summary>Can I order just one jersey?</summary><p>Yes &mdash; no minimum order. Single jerseys for gifts, portfolio pieces and collectors are common. The &euro;15 design deposit is credited in full on orders of 5 or more jerseys.</p></details>\n<details><summary>Who owns the final design?</summary><p>You do. We build it from your concept for your team and never resell it. Finished projects may appear as before/after case studies in our gallery &mdash; tell us if you'd rather not be featured, and we won't.</p></details>\n<details><summary>What does it cost?</summary><p>&euro;15 to put a designer on your concept &mdash; credited in full to orders of 5+ jerseys. Jerseys from &euro;21.90/unit at 10+ (&euro;38.90 single).</p></details>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"cta-end\">\n<h2>Your concept deserves better than a screenshot folder</h2>\n<p>Send it over. A designer will have the first real mockup back to you within 48 hours.</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.momuto.com/pages/request-custom-kit-design#cta-form\" class=\"btn\">Send Your Concept</a>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"more\">Keep exploring: <a href=\"https://www.momuto.com/pages/custom-kit-gallery\">the recreated-designs gallery</a> &middot; <a href=\"https://www.momuto.com/pages/teams-clubs-momuto\">teams already wearing MOMUTO</a> &middot; <a href=\"https://www.momuto.com/blogs/ai-to-reality-kit-maker-guide\">our guide to AI kit design</a> &middot; <a href=\"https://www.momuto.com/pages/design-your-own-soccer-jersey\">design one yourself, free, in 3D</a></div>",
  "detail_url": "https://us.momuto.com/pages/detail/6492313"
}
